# AI coding tools
# Ignore the contents, not the directory itself: git cannot re-include a path
# whose parent directory is excluded, so `!.claude/skills/` requires `.claude/*`.
# Team-shared config is re-included below; local state (`settings.local.json`,
# `plans/`, `sessions/`, `shell-snapshots/`, ...) stays ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
.codebuddy/*
!.codebuddy/settings.json
!.codebuddy/commands/
!.codebuddy/agents/
!.codebuddy/skills/
.workbuddy/*
!.workbuddy/settings.json
!.workbuddy/commands/
!.workbuddy/agents/
!.workbuddy/skills/

# Personal memory overrides (e.g. CLAUDE.local.md, CODEBUDDY.local.md,
# WORKBUDDY.local.md); the shared CLAUDE.md / CODEBUDDY.md / WORKBUDDY.md stay tracked
*.local.md

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc will dump stack traces when hitting an internal compiler error to PWD
rustc-ice-*.txt
